    <briefdescription>
<para>Tensor summary based on locality-sensitive hashing fingerprints. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents results retrieved through fingerprint similarity, used for fast approximate matching without full vector operations. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
